														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1319750">
									

<p>There is something I almost forgot to mention. We wrote thie article with the idea in mind that it would be an appropriate replacement for punishments related to the Foundation that aren't simply &quot;keter duty&quot; or &quot;demotion to D-class&quot;.</p>
<p>The idea of being trapped in that rumbling stone behemoth, knowing that the only thing keeping you alive for long is your finite energy..<br />
The scariest thing about this I think, is that you and you alone are responsible for your death. The cognitive dissonance this creates based on the laws of self-preservation is truly shuddering&#8230; *shudders* Once in it, you can only choose to die now, or later.</p>

							</div>

								
					
