			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1319869">
									

<p>See, this just doesn't do anything more than kill you. It's not like you have a choice in the matter either, seeing as you have limits on your endurance, so there's nothing terribly notable about how it kills you. Do we really need more SCPs that don't do anything except kill anyone they interact with? We already have SCP-198, and it's way better than this.</p>

